	('GK_STEP1_CONFIRM', '선택한 기간에 PeriodLock FA_PREPAID_LOCK을 실행합니다. 계속하시겠습니까?', 'Run PeriodLock FA_PREPAID_LOCK for the selected period. Continue?', 'Chạy PeriodLock FA_PREPAID_LOCK trên kỳ đang chọn. Tiếp tục?', '選択中の期間で PeriodLock FA_PREPAID_LOCK を実行します。続けますか？', 'เรียก PeriodLock FA_PREPAID_LOCK ของงวดที่เลือก ดำเนินการต่อหรือไม่', '对所选期间运行 PeriodLock FA_PREPAID_LOCK。是否继续？', '26-11-16 Simple costing', '2026-11-16 13:24:00', NULL),
