	('GK_STEP1_RESULT_PROCESSING', 'PeriodLock이 FA_PREPAID_LOCK을 처리 중입니다.', 'PeriodLock is processing FA_PREPAID_LOCK.', 'PeriodLock đang xử lý FA_PREPAID_LOCK.', 'PeriodLock が FA_PREPAID_LOCK を処理中です。', 'PeriodLock กำลังประมวลผล FA_PREPAID_LOCK', 'PeriodLock 正在处理 FA_PREPAID_LOCK。', '26-11-20 Step 01 UI', '2026-11-20 15:00:00', NULL),
